# Whitelist: only what the backend image build needs.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!patches
!Dockerfile
!backend
backend/node_modules
backend/dist
# tsc -b would trust these and skip emitting dist in the image
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# TEMPORARY, preview-only seed content (ADR 0009; hand-migration at
# cutover) — the deploy tars these selectively; a local build of the full
# tree sends all of src/assets
!src/content
!src/assets
backend/email-out
backend/.env
backend/.env.*
